# The top rims of thread_pair.tlspr's threaded bolt and of its nut's
# threaded hole picked with the mouse and made a screw mate, which takes
# the threads' lead and moves the nut to where the threads fit; the
# same as path_mate_screw_threads.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/mate_screw_threads). The toolbar is hidden so that
# the fit fills the whole window: where the rims are picked, each lies on
# another entity, and which of the two the mouse takes is the fit's.
file $testdata/ui/thread_pair.tlspr
menu File|Open...
menu View|Show Toolbar
key f
click-entity 8003002d
move 490 266
down L 490 266
up L 490 266
menu Assembly|Mate Screw
